---
title: MediSense AI - End-to-End High-Level Process
---
flowchart LR
    classDef patient fill:#E3F2FD,stroke:#1565C0,color:#000
    classDef doctor  fill:#E8F5E9,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#000
    classDef sec     fill:#FFF3E0,stroke:#EF6C00,color:#000
    classDef admin   fill:#F3E5F5,stroke:#6A1B9A,color:#000
    classDef sys     fill:#ECEFF1,stroke:#455A64,color:#000

    P0([Patient opens app]):::patient --> P1[Login /auth/login]:::patient
    P1 --> G1{Credentials valid?}
    G1 -- no --> P1
    G1 -- yes --> P2[Issue JWT + audit LOGIN]:::sys
    P2 --> P3{Action?}
    P3 -- chat --> CHAT0
    P3 -- book --> BK0
    P3 -- view vitals --> IOT0

    CHAT0[POST /chat]:::patient --> R1[Fetch IoT context 30d]:::sys
    R1 --> R2[Detect language + normalize FR]:::sys
    R2 --> R3[Hybrid retrieval Qdrant+BM25+MCP]:::sys
    R3 --> R4[Safety pre-check]:::sys
    R4 --> G2{Urgent or IoT critical?}
    G2 -- yes --> ESC[Triage URGENT escalate]:::sys
    G2 -- no  --> R5[LLM generate + post-check]:::sys
    R5 --> R6[Return + cache 24h]:::sys
    ESC --> CRM1

    BK0[POST /appointments]:::patient --> BK1[Validate doctor + slot]:::sys
    BK1 --> G3{Conflict?}
    G3 -- yes --> BKERR[409 Conflict]:::sys
    G3 -- no  --> BK2[XGBoost no-show predict]:::sys
    BK2 --> BK3[Persist + risk_color]:::sys
    BK3 --> CRM1[Fire-and-forget CRM task]:::sys

    S0[Secretary opens agenda]:::sec --> S1[GET /predictions/no-show/batch]:::sec
    S1 --> G4{risk_color = red?}
    G4 -- yes --> S2[Dispatch SMS reminders]:::sec
    G4 -- no  --> S3[Monitor CRM tasks]:::sec
    S2 --> S3
    S3 --> S4[Retry failed CRM sync]:::sec

    D0[Doctor dashboard]:::doctor --> D1[View agenda + risk chips]:::doctor
    D1 --> D2[Mark appointment outcome]:::doctor
    D2 --> D3{Anomaly trend high?}
    D3 -- yes --> D4[Review DPA summary]:::doctor
    D4 --> D5[Approve / Reject DPA]:::doctor
    D3 -- no --> DEND([End])

    IOT0[Samsung Watch BLE gateway]:::sys --> IOT1[Kafka iot-vitals]:::sys
    IOT1 --> IOT2[Consumer persists reading]:::sys
    IOT2 --> IOT3[Anomaly detector 5m + 60m LSTM]:::sys
    IOT3 --> G5{Critical?}
    G5 -- yes --> IOT4[FCM push + WebSocket to doctors]:::sys
    G5 -- trending --> IOT5[Trigger DPA summary]:::sys
    IOT4 --> D0
    IOT5 --> D4

    A0[Admin]:::admin --> A1[GET /admin/audit-logs]:::admin
    A0 --> A2[Provision users]:::admin
    A0 --> A3[POST /admin/rerank-eval]:::admin
